      <Variable name="Net Effectiveness" type="numeric" role="utility">
        <Comment><![CDATA[<html>
  <head>
    
  </head>
  <body>
    <p style="margin-top: 0">
      This variable represents the net effectiveness, that is the combination 
      (sum) of two components: the medical effectiveness (represented by the 
      variable Total_QALE) and the economic cost converted into an 
      effectiveness scale (represented by the variable Weighted_Economic_Cost).
    </p>
  </body>
</html>]]></Comment>
